    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d791">

                <pb facs="0767" n="677" xml:id="pg677"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72119/1556</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Moscow</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Summers</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1918-04-04"><hi rendition="#italic">April 4, 1918</hi></date>.
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received April 8, 9.17 a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>313. In reply to demand Soviet government Germany states Ukrainian boundaries
                    will comprise governments Volhynia, Podolsk, Kherson, Ekaterinoslav, Kharkov,
                    Taurida, excluding Crimea, Kiev, Rostov, Chernigov, and part of the government
                    of Kholm, under agreement Central powers.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Summers</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
